# Herstellung-Kästen

Source of truth for markers: `src/lib/sachbuch/herstellung-markup.ts`. Plan prompt: `HERSTELLUNG_PLAN_SYSTEM` in `src/lib/sachbuch/herstellung.ts`.

## Chrome

- **No kind eyebrow** in Preview / ePub / PDF (no small „INFOBOX“ / „MERKSATZ“ / „ONE-PAGER“ line above the box).
- Box heading only when there is a **real content title** (`sachbuchBoxChromeTitle`).
- **Merksatz:** always untitled — body is the pull-quote. Ignore generic titles like „Merksatz“ / „Merksatz für die Praxis“.
- Marker: `<<<BOX merksatz>>>` (no title token).

## Merksatz look & density

- Visual: **grey** box (`border-zinc` / `bg-zinc-100`), not amber.
- **2–3 Merksätze per chapter**, only where a short Lehrsatz / Pull-Quote clearly fits — never pad with fluff.
- Prefer wrapping existing „Merksatz:“ prose; if inserting new ones, keep one pointed sentence (or two short ones).

## Other boxes

- Infobox / One-Pager / Schaubild: content title on the box is OK; still no kind-label chrome.
- Do not invent boxes without text basis; do not use „Montagmorgen“-/Download-Rhetorik for onepagers.
